{'symbol': 'NWL', 'date': '2022-04-01 08:00:00', 'title': 'RESIDEO COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF FIRST ALERT, INC.', 'text': 'SCOTTSDALE, ARIZ. , APRIL 1, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- RESIDEO TECHNOLOGIES, INC. (NYSE: REZI), A LEADING GLOBAL PROVIDER OF HOME COMFORT AND SECURITY SOLUTIONS AND DISTRIBUTOR OF COMMERCIAL AND RESIDENTIAL SECURITY AND AUDIO-VISUAL PRODUCTS, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF FIRST ALERT, INC., A LEADING PROVIDER OF HOME SAFETY PRODUCTS, FROM NEWELL BRANDS INC. (NASDAQ: NWL).'}